# WHITELIST: ignore everything, then allow only the project's own source files.
# This folder also holds the original installer, extracted screensaver, patched builds and
# DXVK archives. None of those may ever be committed.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE
!docs/
!docs/*.md
!patch/
!patch/*.ps1
!patch/*.cmd
!tools/
!tools/*.py
!tools/diagnostics/
!tools/diagnostics/*.py

# Belt and braces: never commit binaries, even if a rule above is loosened later.
*.scr
*.exe
*.dll
*.bak
*.tar
*.gz
*.zip
*.dmp
__pycache__/
